{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20256","headline":"吊卢殷 十 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人哭贤人，骨化气爲星。\n文章飞上天，列宿增晶荧。\n前古文可数，今人文亦灵。\n高名称谪仙，昇降曾莫停。\n有文死更香，无文生亦腥。\n爲君铿好辞，永传作谧宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}